Subject: [PATCH 162/174] go.mod: sing-vmess v0.2.9-pdk.2, with upstream's fix
 of the close after a direct write under Vision

The fork of sing-vmess on the sing of sing-box 1.14.4: upstream's a0c5854 (Vision
closed the connection after a write in direct mode) with our copy loop that
reads the connection under Vision in direct mode on top.
